  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre FIRE 270 is the lightest and most maneuverable racket in the FIRE range. Featuring a 100 sq.in head, 270 g unstrung weight, 330 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern, it is designed for club players and young competitors seeking effortless power and fast handling. X-DAMP technology, developed with TecniLab, reduces harmful vibration by approximately 36%, improving comfort and reducing arm fatigue. Compared with the previous generation, the frame is approximately 5% thinner with a more square profile, while weight has been centralized to improve racket-head acceleration and modern swing speed.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre FIRE 270 是 FIRE 系列中最轻、最灵活的一款球拍，采用100平方英寸拍面、270克空拍重量、330毫米平衡点及16×19开放式线床，主要面向俱乐部球员、青少年比赛球员及进阶初学者。X-DAMP 技术由 TecniLab 开发，通过手柄内部钢制阻尼系统减少约36%的有害震动，大幅提升舒适性并降低手臂疲劳。相比上一代，拍框截面更接近方形且整体薄约5%，重量分布更加集中，使拍头加速更快，更符合现代网球对快速挥拍和轻松发力的需求。"
  },

